{"sourceUrl":"https://sece.sysu.edu.cn/zs/zs01/1421892.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:19:49.028441+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sece.sysu.edu.cn/zs/zs01/1421892.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span><span>中山大学电子与通信工程学院成立于</span></span></span><span><span><span>2017</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>19</span></span></span><span><span><span>日，整建制在深圳办学。深圳是我国信息技术</span></span></span><span><span><span>(IT)</span></span></span><span><span><span>的</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>硅谷</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>，拥有华为、中兴和腾讯等著名</span></span></span><span><span><span>IT</span></span></span><span><span><span>企业。学院植根粤港澳大湾区，将成为区域内重要的电子通信技术知识孵化和人才培养基地。</span></span></span> <span><span><span>学院在电子与通信工程领域的人才培养和科学研究方面有深厚的历史积淀，现有电子科学与技术、信息与通信工程等一级学科，电子科学与技术入选国家</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>双一流</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>建设学科名单，设有信息与通信工程、电子信息等博士点。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>学院发展规划</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>学院面向世界科技前沿、面向经济主战场、面向国家重大需求、面向人民生命健康，将构建特色鲜明的高等教育与研究体系，形成信息与通信工程、电子科学与技术领域内的智能感知技术、认知通信技术、空间电子技术等研究方向和团队，同时积极培育和引导电子通信学科和新兴学科的交叉融合发展，包括人工智能、网络空间安全和生物信息处理等。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>师资队伍建设</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p> <span><span><span>目前电子与通信工程学院拥有完整的工科学士、硕士、博士、博士后人才培养体系，正组建一支以优秀中青年教师为骨干，年龄结构合理、高素质、充满活力、实力雄厚的教学、科研队伍。现有学院有教职工</span></span></span><span><span><span>96</span></span></span><span><span><span>名，其中教授</span></span></span><span><span><span>28</span></span></span><span><span><span>名，副教授</span></span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span><span><span>名，助理教授</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>名，专职研究员</span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>名，博士后</span></span></span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span><span><span><span>名，党政管理人员</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>名，实验技术人员</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>名。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>发展方向介绍</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span> 1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>智能感知技术</span></span></span></p>\n<p> <span><span><span>研究目标：瞄准陆海空天监视、高分对地观测、低小慢目标防护、网络空间安全等重大需求，结合人工智能领域的最新进展，开展新体制雷达、高分辨成像雷达、气象探测、计算机视觉、网络电磁空间态势认知与利用、一体化综合感知等基础理论与关键技术研究，为粤港澳大湾区乃至国家战略发展提供支撑。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span> 2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>认知通信技术</span></span></span></p>\n<p> <span><span><span>研究目标：面向高移动性通信、高速率大容量通信、深空深海通信、物联网通信等的需求，开展信息编码与传输、网络编码与网络安全和大规模巨址接入等核心技术的研究，开展海量物联网、天地海一体化智能信息网络等新兴信息技术，为地方经济发展电子信息产业提供专业人才和技术支持，服务国家信息化发展战略需求。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span> 3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>空间电子技术</span></span></span></p>\n<p> <span><span><span>研究目标：瞄准国家大力发展空间技术的战略需求和深圳市政府在航空航天领域的科技创新发展规划，开展卫星通信、导航、探测、遥感等前沿技术和创新应用研究，促进空间电子学科交叉融合、复合人才培养，服务国家空间技术战略需求。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sece.sysu.edu.cn/zs/zs01/1421892.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>我院现组织开展</span></span></span></a><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生预报名工作，请符合申请条件的申请人（包括本校应届生）按以下通知内容报名</span></span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（一）中华人民共和国公民；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（二）拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（三）在目前就读学校取得</span></span></span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span><span>预计可取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（四）学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和作为博士、硕士研究生培养的潜质；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（五）诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（六）身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（七）入学前须本科毕业并获得学士学位；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（八）其余申请条件要符合中山大学推荐免试研究生招生章程及接收办法中的要求。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>二、招生专业</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>范围：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>获得教育部</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>注册报名资格的应届优秀本科毕业生。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>专业：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>电子信息类、计算机等相关学科。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\"/></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span>说明：实际招生专业以学校最终公布的</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span>年研究生招生专业目录为准。各专业实际接收推免生人数将根据招生计划、生源情况等进行调整，以实际录取为准。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>三、申请材料</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>《中山大学</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span>年接收免试研究生（含直博生）申请表》（附件</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>份，请本人亲笔签字，所在院系盖章；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>个人简历（限两页纸以内，包括学习经历、感兴趣的专业与方向，曾经做过的研究工作及未来学习、研究计划、目标，不少于</span></span></span><span><span><span>1500 </span></span></span><span><span><span>字）；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免资格证明原件，须加盖推荐院校公章（若是无法在期限内提交，请先提交公示信息）；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>历年在校学习成绩单原件</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>份、总评成绩排名证明文件</span></span></span><span><span><span> 1 </span></span></span><span><span><span>份，相关材料须由所在学校或学院教务部门盖章；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span><span>国家英语四级</span></span></span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span><span>六级考试成绩证明复印件；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span><span>身份证复印件（须正反面复印在</span></span></span><span><span><span>A4</span></span></span><span><span><span>纸的同一面上）；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span><span><span><span>学生证复印件（个人信息页和注册信息页扫描在同一张</span></span></span><span><span><span>A4</span></span></span><span><span><span>纸上）；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>8.</span></span></span><span><span><span>其它有关材料</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>份（该部份材料不作为必须提供材料内容，供我院审核、接收时参考），如获奖证书复印件及申请人提交的体现本人学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等（同类成果最多</span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>项）。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>申请者须承诺所提供信息、材料及申请身份的真实性。一经查证为不属实或不符合我校招生要求的，我校将取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>申请者若存在有违学术道德、专业伦理、诚实守信等方面的不当行为，一经查实，立即取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>四、申请流程</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>报名要求：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>13</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>23:59</span></span></span><span><span><span>前，请登录中山大学研究生报名系统（网址：</span></span></span><span><span><span>https://enroll.sysu.edu.cn/</span></span></span><span><span><span>）填写报名信息，如参加了我院</span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年科学营请在备注栏填写</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>已参加科学营</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>，并将申请材料按要求上传至报名系统。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>申请材料提交要求：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>第</span></span></span><span><span><span>1-8</span></span></span><span><span><span>项按照顺序整合成一个</span></span></span><span><span><span>pdf</span></span></span><span><span><span>文件，命名方式为：</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免生申请</span></span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span><span><span><span>姓名</span></span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span><span><span><span>报名专业</span></span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span><span><span><span>申请类型</span></span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span><span><span><span>备注<span><span>（如参加了我</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>院2026年科学营请备注“已参加科学营”）</span></span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>特别提醒：本次预报名仅需提交电子版材料。仅在网上系统申报而未上传指定申请材料者，将视为材料不全，报名不予受理。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>五、初审与考核</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>（一）材料审核</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>我院将根据工作安排，对申请者信息进行初审后，择优确定复试名单并通知申请者参加考核。复试名单将在我院官网发布，未进入名单的同学不再另行通知。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>复试报到、复试日期、时间及地点的具体安排将在我院官网公布，并通过</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>预报名系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>发出邮件通知。获得复试资格的申请者在参加复试时，须按要求提交申请材料第</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>项的原件或纸质版文件。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>（二）复试考核</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>1. </span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>复试形式：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>现场复试。学院将根据报名情况进行初步筛选确定复试名单，并于学院官网公布，届时请同学们留意。第一轮复试初步安排在</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span><span><span><span>日左右，计划以线下考核的方式，如有变动将另行通知。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>2. </span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>复试总分：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>100 </span></span></span><span><span><span>分，其中</span></span></span><span><span><span> 30%</span></span></span><span><span><span>为英语考核，</span></span></span><span><span><span>70%</span></span></span><span><span><span>为业务能力及综合素质考核。直博生及硕士生分别排序，复试均依照同样的程序进行。同一专业内，所有的推荐免试研究生申请人均同批参加复试。复试总成绩</span></span></span><span><span><span>60</span></span></span><span><span><span>分及格，复试不及格者不参加排序，及格者按复试成绩从高到低择优预录取。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>3. </span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>考核时间：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>硕士推免生的面试总时间（含外语应用能力考核）不少于</span></span></span><span><span><span> 20 </span></span></span><span><span><span>分钟，直博生的面试总时间（含外语应用能力考核）不少于</span></span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span><span><span>分钟。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>4. </span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>考核方式：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>以面试为主。复试小组对参加复试的考生进行逐个考核，考生当场回答问题或操作，必要时，复试小组成员会就相关问题进一步提问。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>5. </span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>复试内容：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>重点考察外语应用能力、专业素质及能力、实践（实验）能力、思想政治素质和品德、心理健康状况等。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>6. </span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>考核评分：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>每位考生复试结束后，由复试小组成员现场独立为考生评分。复试小组成员考核总分的算术平均值为该考生的最终复试成绩。成绩按四舍五入原则，保留小数点后两位。复试成绩不及格（低于</span></span></span><span><span><span> 60 </span></span></span><span><span><span>分）者，不予录取及格者按复试成绩从高到低择优预录取。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>复试实行差额复试，根据复试成绩择优录取，未按规定参加复试或复试不及格者不予录取。复试过程全程录音录像。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>六、考核通过名单公布</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>我院将根据复试情况，择优确定考核通过名单并于我院官网公布。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>考核通过者，我院后续将结合招生计划与实际录取情况，通过教育部</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>向拟接收的申请人发送待录取通知，收到待录取通知的申请者，须在规定时间内在</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>上完成待录取确认，逾期未完成确认者视为放弃待录取资格。在</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>上完成待录取确认的推免生不得变更录取志愿，不得撤销待录取。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>七、其他事项</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>说明</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>此通知为预推免报名通知，具体要求以教育部及中山大学</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生接收工作相关及接收办法通知为准。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>推免生的报名及录取均通过教育部</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>（以下简称</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>，网址</span></span></span><span><span><span>: https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/</span></span></span><span><span><span>）进行。所有推免生（含</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>免试硕士生</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>和</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>直博生</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>）均需按照教育部、本科所在学校和省市招办要求在规定时间内登录教育部推荐免试服务系统，完成资格审查、填报志愿、缴纳报名费、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>推免复审及体检要求请留意学校及院系后续发布的推免接收办法及相关通知。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>联系方式</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>联系人：蓝老师</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>咨询电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span>0755-23260175</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></span><span><a href=\"mailto:secejw@mail.sysu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span>secejw@mail.sysu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>地址：<span>深圳市光明区公常路</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>66</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>号工学园</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3-</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>北</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>503</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>办公室，邮编</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>518107</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span>电子与通信工程学院</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<br/>\n<p> 相关附件:<br/>\n\n1、<a href=\"https://sece.sysu.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/20260902172014297553.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"中山大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）申请表（须所在单位盖章）.docx\">中山大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）申请表（须所在单位盖章）</a><br/>\n</p>\n</div>","textSha256":"8d2ebe1469580e4f7d23880c09573647679d92903995dde13d6f0d51494d071b","textLength":3561,"sourceSha256":"529b8a973e48ef013f568948a9c698b16aa0f7a986289c4fdbe20f2519de9b18","selector":".cont","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a31b4456be8d33f76dcd","title":"2026年中山大学电子与通信工程学院关于2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:19:49.028441+00:00"}
